# Proof packs (docs/guide/concepts-proof.md).
title: A proof pack ties every promise in a story to evidence that CI collected
direction: down
criteria: The story's promises: numbered criteria
pr: The pull request's head commit
gate: Merge gate in CI runs the checks again
pack: Proof pack: evidence for each criterion
ship: ship reads the pack before it merges
criteria -> gate
pr -> gate
gate -> pack
pack -> ship
